      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Early Black settlers arrived as tenant farmers, establishing churches, a school, and community spots like George Tucker Café and Big Apple Club.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
